{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_04_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48dbd521fece83d18c444d6f206fadfc7867c7058b8c48869107b7790d6ab22b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2af4c9f217bccd1f1b99c1a590dc7eaf6266085b6d8ace27a6c112d06b64747",
      "text": "哟，●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n方便聊聊吗？有件事想跟你说说。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7deb1e18dd04fafee608d2a203cceabc1c1038defe9279cbb8e16996732c8b7b",
      "text": "其实，我听到风声说Legenders要去参加\n《大扫除解决队》的试镜了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1782402ce6bfcda6035445e491f3162473574e4e097dd35f4a50657172ca3ca5",
      "text": "那个节目，意外地有很多派得上用场的情报啊。\n所以我也经常在看……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b67b96b7819a2f558e1701e9d139b4256432c4b24a5f9aa46f8c9e00bdb31e48",
      "text": "特别是关于衣物清洗的信息，\n我每次都不会错过。前阵子也是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a97ff0bb69d3ceb85255a3968a511d72f37ae3eca7aeedd6ede366611412ac90",
      "text": "……哎呀，糟糕。洗衣服的话题先打住，\n今天我还有别的事必须要传达。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000036:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30045c12bfb2b5d1c35520e7396a3158d140c2ca92171280234909818ec07ee6",
      "text": "莫非\n玄武先生也是来加油助威的？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34675d61a3dc883a203e7aa1c032ff50ad23c47d6baa7fa9b5e4d3b308f3265b",
      "text": "“也”，这么说的话……难道说，\n除我之外还有别人打电话来加油了吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde08024f4fbafb43dd33f163c929a6107002b9f3b501b959f7015e68a69d637",
      "text": "……哈哈，原来如此。\n庄一郎大哥也打电话来了啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000042:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08b2b31abd476608de9799d13bcc75374d70d15237a258c470e96e758bb3db1a",
      "text": "怎么说呢，真不错啊，咱们事务所。\n聚集了一群真正热血的同伴啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000044:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b82a8313216728fa74a07ffbc8d07bd8b16b20332c08e2d73c83a7a79030c1b",
      "text": "那么，我差不多挂了。要是合格了的话，\n我绝对会看的。给你们加油啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000060:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eca5bbb1fa78d35aa198d3e81e0dba68b9083054421ede6d539e7ce9a5b7d45",
      "text": "试镜会场",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aa8a7852285816ec28bbbf318b08ae6b89e7760842b6901efd8d8a0e86e9d8f",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，欢迎你们来！我看看，\n是“Legenders”啊……嗯嗯，原来如此。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0202ce58c58b3bfe0f37e842304ec6cdffb1236ec80c49f11a3419019012505c",
      "text": "那么事不宜迟就开始提问吧。首先是你！\n简历上写着“前保洁员”对吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da5b57ff25fcff79b175646352f5bc0286fbf5ce9c8d3e2eedb7139a032de76c",
      "text": "是的。我想在这次的节目里，\n也能活用这份经验。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c40cf3190e4612067540ba8c6ebf6d88f57edb1dca93e4f8b5f98820722eee15",
      "text": "我之前隶属于一家叫妖怪保洁社的地方。\n以前也曾因为清扫委托来过这栋楼。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa500a838426e08b50eda9a6fadd5a7d272a5d223eb1a3c0ab123008ae44d88f",
      "text": "竟然在那家业内无人不知的保洁公司待过吗。\n原来如此。葛之叶君，我看你相当有两把刷子啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0beb91b9255759858dfa46f44600c9bde717ed496d58407f2ca3c45267a888e",
      "text": "那么接下来，旁边的你！\n有什么关于打扫的小故事吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e49724703df1a961d0fa50df388e29860b09a0ac216bc816e769a73a049412ff",
      "text": "好的，这个嘛……关于打扫方面，\n我自认有着普通人水准的注意与留心。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf46b8d125718ed3ebdfed109d3a85e393014721d8d8a18cfefb119e8b94266",
      "text": "嗯嗯，普通人水准啊。\n那么，旁边的你呢？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c8e6cf1c1d5d0dcc1a85d8d2fafffcd7e361a225746fe00a2726a7f32115d7f",
      "text": "我也差不多是这样～不过，\n平时雨彦先生都会教我各种各样的诀窍～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc2fb132b9fc736276d8a11ff5250528ba0bb1418a100bb2381c651216ba44f8",
      "text": "看来葛之叶君的清扫技术，那是相当\n了不得啊！原来如此，不妨来详细聊聊吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f970aed1595d7e4ee6196228542a07f2610232254e32c9bea842d4868a0ddf7c",
      "text": "好的……比如前几天节目中提到的\n污渍种类那一期……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3ebd20c6fc4ab5b03fe83aab395744ab334448778fe134d63f9d93aae17e291",
      "text": "嗯嗯，完全听懂了！\n那么，试镜就到这里！谢谢各位！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:670eab96acff0ab1cfaaa032a42b4f11b1cae4f1630540cfdda3e66dcae33fe7",
      "text": "……啊，制作人君。你能稍微留一下\n吗？我有点事想跟你聊聊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
